                    Presidential Materials, NSC Files, NSC Institutional Files (H-Files), Box H–126,
                    National Security Study Memoranda, NSSM 2.
                    Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1-f2-content">
                <p>The first study required by this NSSM is
                    scheduled for publication in <ref target="frus1969-76v23">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, volume XXIII,
                        Arab-Israeli Dispute, 1969–1972</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
